# Tattered Ratter (a Human Peasant, not a Rat) gets no bonus when it is blocked itself: it deals 2 damage to Fortified Rampart.
# (An unblocked Rat gets nothing: see the next scenario.) A Rat blocked by two creatures (Fortified Rampart and Ornithopter)
# triggers it once, not once per blocker: the Muck Rats are 3/1 afterwards, not 5/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Tattered Ratter
Muck Rats
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Fortified Rampart
Ornithopter
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tattered Ratter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Muck Rats.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Fortified Rampart.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Tattered Ratter > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Fortified Rampart > Tattered Ratter)
? Stack.Count = 0
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Fortified Rampart.Damage = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tattered Ratter.Power = 2
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Muck Rats > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Fortified Rampart > Muck Rats; Ornithopter > Muck Rats)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Muck Rats.Power = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Muck Rats.Power = 3
Bot2.Life = 20
